  "_source": {
    "title": "焊盘外形",
    "remarks.text.0": "焊盘当前存在以下四种 {@link EPCB_PrimitivePadShapeType | 外形种类}：",
    "remarks.text.1": "① 圆形",
    "remarks.text.2": "`[EPCB_PrimitivePadShapeType.ELLIPSE, width, height]`",
    "remarks.text.3": "- `{number}` `width` - 宽",
    "remarks.text.4": "- `{number}` `height` - 高",
    "remarks.text.5": "② 矩形",
    "remarks.text.6": "`[EPCB_PrimitivePadShapeType.RECTANGLE, width, height, round]`",
    "remarks.text.7": "- `{number}` `width` - 宽",
    "remarks.text.8": "- `{number}` `height` - 高",
    "remarks.text.9": "- `{number}` `round` - 圆角半径",
    "remarks.text.10": "③ 正多边形",
    "remarks.text.11": "`[EPCB_PrimitivePadShapeType.REGULAR_POLYGON, diameter, numberOfSides]`",
    "remarks.text.12": "- `{number}` `diameter` - 直径",
    "remarks.text.13": "- `{number}` `numberOfSides` - 边数（＞ 2）",
    "remarks.text.14": "④ 折线复杂多边形",
    "remarks.text.15": "`[EPCB_PrimitivePadShapeType.POLYLINE_COMPLEX_POLYGON, complexPolygon]`",
    "remarks.text.16": "- `{TPCB_PolygonSourceArray | Array<TPCB_PolygonSourceArray>}` `complexPolygon` - 复杂多边形源数组，可以使用 {@link IPCB_ComplexPolygon.getSource} 获取"
  },
